# Back to it, state d: the screen woken (no screen lock is set) and the keyguard dismissed; what it
# shows; if neither the group list nor a question is there (the program no longer running), it is
# started from its launcher and unlocked (k2a-bg-reopen.flow).
key WAKEUP
sleep 2
sh wm dismiss-keyguard
sleep 4
dialog
list
ifnot (fabAddNew|Merge.changes) 5 k2a-bg-reopen.flow
